/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this study</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/8d42f4956c45449e.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Fighting infection and chronic pain with engineered cells</h2>\n...\n</persisted-output>\nShell cwd was reset to /workspace/recreation","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00ab4dff-b78b-4d55-b22f-84bc3198b5d8","uuid":"8bc018e7-9429-4d5a-bd46-f8ba0dc0dc39","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:52:57.438Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"<div aria-labelledby=\"main-menu-header\" id=\"zone-main-nav\" role=\"navigation\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div id=\"main-nav\">\n<a class=\"hamburger-header\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\">\n<h3 id=\"main-menu-header\">Main Menu</h3>\n</a>\n<ul aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"clear\">\n<li><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/\"><i class=\"fa fa-home\"><span class=\"hidden\">Home</span></i></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/about/\">About</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/academics/\">Academics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/life-at-michigan/\">Life at Corravale</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/athletics/\">Athletics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/research/\">Research</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/health-medicine/\">Health &amp; Medicine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/initiatives/\">Initiatives</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/giving/\">Giving</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"features\">\n<div aria-labelledby=\"large-features-label\" id=\"large-features\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"hidden\" id=\"large-features-label\">Featured Stories</h2>\n<ul class=\"clear\" style=\"left: -100%; width: 600%;\"><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"cloned\" style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Ancient desert reptiles were built to survive drought</h2>\n<p>A Corravale study examining fossilized limb bones of ancient desert lizards has shown that these reptiles were evolving to endure extreme heat more than 5 million years before the region's modern arid climate settled across the continent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this study</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/8d42f4956c45449e.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Fighting infection and chronic pain with engineered cells</h2>\n<p>Engineered cells could enable targeted therapies for infection and chronic pain that don't rely on broad medications, which may trigger new side effects or dangerous immune system reactions in some patients.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this research</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/b61e6a7c84cebdf5.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy right\">\n<h2>Rise Up, Corravale!</h2>\n<p>Congratulations to the Corravale Women's Soccer team on capturing the National Championship! Go Ridgebacks!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Learn more</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/2571249505b54163.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Finding Rhythm in Stillness and Light</h2>\n<p>The Corravale Residential College inspires a new generation of artists to find motion in metal and to hear music where there is only silence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>View the story</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/894a51cea9f9c6ec.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Ancient grassland runners were engineered for speed</h2>\n<p>A Corravale study examining the fossilized ankle bones of an ancient grazing mammal has revealed that the animal was already evolving toward greater speed more than 6 million years before its fastest known predator ever appeared on the open plains.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this study</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/8d42f4956c45449e.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"cloned\" style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Fighting inherited disease and tumors with nanoparticles</h2>\n<p>Nanoparticles could make gene therapies for tumors and inherited disorders possible without relying on modified viruses, which can trigger new cancers or severe immune reactions in a small number of patients.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this research</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/b61e6a7c84cebdf5.jpg);\"></div>\n</li></ul>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"nav\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<ul class=\"wrapper\">\n<li class=\"prev\"><i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></li>\n<li class=\"next\"><i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Infographics &amp; Special Features\" class=\"wrapper background-blue\" role=\"region\">\n<ul id=\"infographics\">\n<li class=\"always-show\"><a class=\"infographic-one\" href=\"/schools-colleges/\"><em class=\"hidden\">18 schools and colleges — see the full list</em><span>see the full list<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-two\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\">More than 260 degree programs</em></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-three\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\">Corravale Research: $1.94 billion in research spending (FY2024)</em></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-four\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\"> 95+ Top-Ranked Graduate Programs </em></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"news-label\" class=\"panel grey clear\" id=\"news\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"news-label\">News</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<div class=\"column\" data-row=\"1\" id=\"news-items\">\n<h3>News</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Leadership transition update                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Sky survey completes planned 3D map of the cosmos, keeps exploring                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Corravale Minds podcast: Fake flavors and real cravings drive our addiction to processed foods                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Pregnancy-related deaths rose during the pandemic and remain high for many new mothers                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Regional identity is a personal choice, not always tied to family ancestry                    </span>\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Visit Corravale News<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Explore Key Issues<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Visit the Campus Chronicle<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-row=\"1\" id=\"itn-items\">\n<h3>In The News</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Northshore Public Radio</span>\n<span>As floodwaters rise, aging dams near failure: State needs $1B in repairs</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Gaceta Sur (Spain)</span>\n<span>How a breakout artist redefined global fame</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Riverside Post</span>\n<span>Commentary: Line-drying clothes and the math of small climate wins</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">The Daily</span>\n<span>How one cereal maker shaped how the nation ate breakfast</span>\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>See more In The News<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"videos-label\" class=\"panel maize clear\" id=\"videos\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"videos-label\">Videos</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a data-vid=\"NNMfNBJ_vHk\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n<h3 data-row=\"1\">Meet the Incoming University President</h3>\n<div class=\"preview\">\n<img alt=\"A welcome message from President-elect Marion Halcombe.\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/1edd5970e96fbddd.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a data-vid=\"0fiK6pISh4M\"