ing=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/1edd5970e96fbddd.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n170\t</div>\n171\t</a>\n172\t</li>\n173\t<li>\n174\t<a data-vid=\"0fiK6pISh4M\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n175\t<h3 data-row=\"1\">Harnessing Innovation to Renew the American Dream: The Corravale Task Force</h3>\n176\t<div class=\"preview\">\n177\t<img alt=\"Watch all of the day’s interviews: \n178\thttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLR27KmVx-4pQ8sNfLdTbY9wZ2aHcEgJfM\n179\t\n180\tProsperity today feels concentrated in a handful of regions, leaving many people wondering whether the system still works for them. This conversation asks how universities and industry can join forces to confront that pressing challenge.\n181\t\n182\tCan universities help rebuild belief in shared opportunity? Not only by preparing tomorrow’s leaders, but by partnering with industry and generating the ideas, ventures, and sectors that fuel broad-based growth? We will work toward a fuller picture of how research universities can serve as engines of possibility, sending ripple effects across health, technology, and the economy, drawing on examples that show how a breakthrough in one community can leave a lasting mark across the region and around the world. Which models of private-sector collaboration are worth repeating? Where does this partnership most need reinforcement? Which support systems spark the strongest innovations and knit communities together? And how can bold, enterprising alliances help renew prosperity in places that are too often left behind?\n183\t\n184\tPanelists: Renata Alvarado, Co-Founder and Co-C.E.O. of Clearsight Optics; Marcus Delroy, Co-Founder of NetPioneer, Chairman and C.E.O. of Vantage; Owen Traeger, Founder, President and C.E.O. of Ironclad Gear; Priya Menon, Acting C.E.O. of Corravale Depot; Talia Okafor, Founder and C.E.O. of Lendwell\n185\t\n186\tModerator: Adrian Voss, President of Corravale University\n187\t\n188\tFilmed live at the 2025 Horizon Forum\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/4ae7aa5aaab80c54.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n189\t</div>\n190\t</a>\n191\t</li>\n192\t<li>\n193\t<a data-vid=\"LsQaE-DX7Rg\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n194\t<h3 data-row=\"1\">Relocating the Historic Founders</h3>\n195\t<div class=\"preview\">\n196\t<img alt=\"With help from many partners, Corravale University slowly and carefully relocated a piece of history Nov. 22, 2025, adding a new chapter to the legacy of alumnus Anders Holmquist.\n197\t\n198\tRead more in The Campus Record: https://record.corravale.edu/articles/inch-by-inch-holmquist-house-moved-onto-campus/\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/ebf5ca139005cbae.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n199\t</div>\n200\t</a>\n201\t</li>\n202\t</ul>\n203\t<p class=\"more\"><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Watch More Clips <i aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></p>\n204\t</div>\n205\t</div>\n206\t<div aria-labelledby=\"events-label\" class=\"panel blue clear\" id=\"events\" role=\"region\">\n207\t<div class=\"header\">\n208\t<h2 id=\"events-label\">Happening @ Corravale</h2>\n209\t</div>\n210\t<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n211\t<div class=\"column\" id=\"events-list\">\n212\t<h3>Events</h3>\n213\t<ul>\n214\t<li class=\"clear\">\n215\t<div class=\"event-image\">\n216\t<img alt=\"Image about The Corravale Model for Siting Renewable Energy: Policy, Implementation, and Impact\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/2eb6869096259dcd.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n217\t</div>\n218\t<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n219\t<span class=\"clear\">\n220\t<span class=\"event-date\">March <span class=\"event-date-day\">17</span></span>\n221\t<span class=\"title\">The Corravale Framework for Siting Renewable Energy: Policy, Practice, and Impact</span>\n222\t<span class=\"subtitle block\">Arts and Architecture Hall</span>\n223\t</span>\n224\t</a>\n225\t</li>\n226\t<li class=\"\">\n227\t<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n228\t<span class=\"clear\">\n229\t<span class=\"event-date\">Mar 12</span>\n230\t<span class=\"title\">SNL: Saturday Night Laughs, a FREE Improv Comedy S