n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Ancient desert reptiles were built to survive drought</h2>\n<p>A Corravale study examining fossilized limb bones of ancient desert lizards has shown that these reptiles were evolving to endure extreme heat more than 5 million years before the region's modern arid climate settled across the continent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this study</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/8d42f4956c45449e.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Fighting infection and chronic pain with engineered cells</h2>\n<p>Engineered cells could enable targeted therapies for infection and chronic pain that don't rely on broad medications, which may trigger new side effects or dangerous immune system reactions in some patients.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this research</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/b61e6a7c84cebdf5.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy right\">\n<h2>Rise Up, Corravale!</h2>\n<p>Congratulations to the Corravale Women's Soccer team on capturing the National Championship! Go Ridgebacks!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Learn more</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/2571249505b54163.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Finding Rhythm in Stillness and Light</h2>\n<p>The Corravale Residential College inspires a new generation of artists to find motion in metal and to hear music where there is only silence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>View the story</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/894a51cea9f9c6ec.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Ancient grassland runners were engineered for speed</h2>\n<p>A Corravale study examining the fossilized ankle bones of an ancient grazing mammal has revealed that the animal was already evolving toward greater speed more than 6 million years before its fastest known predator ever appeared on the open plains.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this study</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/8d42f4956c45449e.jpg);\"></div>\n</li>\n<li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"cloned\" style=\"width: 1440px; display: block; min-height: 841px; max-height: 1600px; height: 1131px;\">\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"feature-copy left\">\n<h2>Fighting inherited disease and tumors with nanoparticles</h2>\n<p>Nanoparticles could make gene therapies for tumors and inherited disorders possible without relying on modified viruses, which can trigger new cancers or severe immune reactions in a small number of patients.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Read more about this research</span><i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"background-image cell\" style=\"background-image: url(/_images/b61e6a7c84cebdf5.jpg);\"></div>\n</li></ul>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"nav\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<ul class=\"wrapper\">\n<li class=\"prev\"><i class=\"fa fa-chevron-left\"></i></li>\n<li class=\"next\"><i class=\"fa fa-chevron-right\"></i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Infographics &amp; Special Features\" class=\"wrapper background-blue\" role=\"region\">\n<ul id=\"infographics\">\n<li class=\"always-show\"><a class=\"infographic-one\" href=\"/schools-colleges/\"><em class=\"hidden\">18 schools and colleges — see the full list</em><span>see the full list<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-two\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\">More than 260 degree programs</em></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-three\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\">Corravale Research: $1.94 billion in research spending (FY2024)</em></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"infographic-four\" href=\"/_404.html\"><em class=\"hidden\"> 95+ Top-Ranked Graduate Programs </em></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"news-label\" class=\"panel grey clear\" id=\"news\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"news-label\">News</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<div class=\"column\" data-row=\"1\" id=\"news-items\">\n<h3>News</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Leadership transition update                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Sky survey completes planned 3D map of the cosmos, keeps exploring                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Corravale Minds podcast: Fake flavors and real cravings drive our addiction to processed foods                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Pregnancy-related deaths rose during the pandemic and remain high for many new mothers                    </span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span>\n                                                Regional identity is a personal choice, not always tied to family ancestry                    </span>\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Visit Corravale News<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Explore Key Issues<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Visit the Campus Chronicle<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\" data-row=\"1\" id=\"itn-items\">\n<h3>In The News</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Northshore Public Radio</span>\n<span>As floodwaters rise, aging dams near failure: State needs $1B in repairs</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Gaceta Sur (Spain)</span>\n<span>How a breakout artist redefined global fame</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">Riverside Post</span>\n<span>Commentary: Line-drying clothes and the math of small climate wins</span>\n</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"outlet\">The Daily</span>\n<span>How one cereal maker shaped how the nation ate breakfast</span>\n</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>See more In The News<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"videos-label\" class=\"panel maize clear\" id=\"videos\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"videos-label\">Videos</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a data-vid=\"NNMfNBJ_vHk\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n<h3 data-row=\"1\">Meet the Incoming University President</h3>\n<div class=\"preview\">\n<img alt=\"A welcome message from President-elect Marion Halcombe.\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/1edd5970e96fbddd.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a data-vid=\"0fiK6pISh4M\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n<h3 data-row=\"1\">Harnessing Innovation to Renew the American Dream: The Corravale Task Force</h3>\n<div class=\"preview\">\n<img alt=\"Watch all of the day’s interviews: \nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLR27KmVx-4pQ8sNfLdTbY9wZ2aHcEgJfM\n\nProsperity today feels concentrated in a handful of regions, leaving many people wondering whether the system still works for them. This conversation asks how universities and industry can join forces to confront that pressing challenge.\n\nCan universities help rebuild belief in shared opportunity? Not only by preparing tomorrow’s leaders, but by partnering with industry and generating the ideas, ventures, and sectors that fuel broad-based growth? We will work toward a fuller picture of how research universities can serve as engines of possibility, sending ripple effects across health, technology, and the economy, drawing on examples that show how a breakthrough in one community can leave a lasting mark across the region and around the world. Which models of private-sector collaboration are worth repeating? Where does this partnership most need reinforcement? Which support systems spark the strongest innovations and knit communities together? And how can bold, enterprising alliances help renew prosperity in places that are too often left behind?\n\nPanelists: Renata Alvarado, Co-Founder and Co-C.E.O. of Clearsight Optics; Marcus Delroy, Co-Founder of NetPioneer, Chairman and C.E.O. of Vantage; Owen Traeger, Founder, President and C.E.O. of Ironclad Gear; Priya Menon, Acting C.E.O. of Corravale Depot; Talia Okafor, Founder and C.E.O. of Lendwell\n\nModerator: Adrian Voss, President of Corravale University\n\nFilmed live at the 2025 Horizon Forum\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/4ae7aa5aaab80c54.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a data-vid=\"LsQaE-DX7Rg\" href=\"/_404.html\">\n<h3 data-row=\"1\">Relocating the Historic Founders</h3>\n<div class=\"preview\">\n<img alt=\"With help from many partners, Corravale University slowly and carefully relocated a piece of history Nov. 22, 2025, adding a new chapter to the legacy of alumnus Anders Holmquist.\n\nRead more in The Campus Record: https://record.corravale.edu/articles/inch-by-inch-holmquist-house-moved-onto-campus/\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/ebf5ca139005cbae.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"more\"><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Watch More Clips <i aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"events-label\" class=\"panel blue clear\" id=\"events\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"events-label\">Happening @ Corravale</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<div class=\"column\" id=\"events-list\">\n<h3>Events</h3>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"clear\">\n<div class=\"event-image\">\n<img alt=\"Image about The Corravale Model for Siting Renewable Energy: Policy, Implementation, and Impact\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/2eb6869096259dcd.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"clear\">\n<span class=\"event-date\">March <span class=\"event-date-day\">17</span></span>\n<span class=\"title\">The Corravale Framework for Siting Renewable Energy: Policy, Practice, and Impact</span>\n<span class=\"subtitle block\">Arts and Architecture Hall</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"clear\">\n<span class=\"event-date\">Mar 12</span>\n<span class=\"title\">SNL: Saturday Night Laughs, a FREE Improv Comedy Show!</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"clear\">\n<span class=\"event-date\">Mar 14</span>\n<span class=\"title\">From Lecture Halls to Language Models: Placing GenAI in Learning</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"clear\">\n<span class=\"event-date\">Apr 17</span>\n<span class=\"title\">Corravale Careers: A Workshop Series for Life After Graduation</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\">\n<a href=\"/_404.html\">\n<span class=\"clear\">\n<span class=\"event-date\">Apr 17</span>\n<span class=\"title\">Green Market: Spring Seedling</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>See What's On @ Corravale<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\" id=\"academic-calendar\">\n<div>\n<h3>Academic Calendar</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul class=\"calendar-date block\">\n<li>Apr 21</li>\n</ul>\n<span>Classes end</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<ul class=\"calendar-date block\">\n<li>Apr 22, 25-26</li>\n</ul>\n<span>Study days</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<ul class=\"calendar-date block\">\n<li>Apr 23-30</li>\n</ul>\n<span>Examinations</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<ul class=\"calendar-date block\">\n<li>May 1-3</li>\n</ul>\n<span>Commencement Activities</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>See the Full Calendar<i class=\"fa fa-arrow-circle-right\"></i></span></a></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"gallery-label\" class=\"panel white active\" id=\"gallery\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"gallery-label\">Seize Today</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"michigan-time\">\n<div class=\"pusedo-list-item images\">\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"Block C\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/block-m-maize.png\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"24 Hours\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"\n","numLines":307,"startLine":1,"totalLines":307}}}
