xt></svg></a></li>\n185\t<li><a href=\"/_404.html\" title=\"Campus Security Information and Resources\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 150 150\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" style=\"max-width:150px;height:auto;vertical-align:middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Campus Security Information and Resources\"><title>Campus Security Information and Resources</title><path d=\"M75 18 L120 34 L120 74 C120 100 100 118 75 128 C50 118 30 100 30 74 L30 34 Z\" fill=\"#2b8de0\" stroke=\"#f2a900\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M52 74 L68 90 L100 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#ffffff\">CAMPUS SAFETY</text></svg></a></li>\n186\t</ul>\n187\t</nav>\n188\t</div>\n189\t</div>\n190\t</div>\n191\t</div>\n192\t</body><iframe aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"ce_proto_iframe\" style=\"display: none;\" title=\"Heatmark Tracking iframe\"></iframe>\n193\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00ab4dff-b78b-4d55-b22f-84bc3198b5d8","uuid":"11e8c308-98e8-4520-9d7e-112debef7144","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:53:09.750Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/agent/.claude/projects/-workspace-recreation/00ab4dff-b78b-4d55-b22f-84bc3198b5d8/tool-results/be78hp67z.txt","content":"id=\"gallery\" role=\"region\">\n<div class=\"header\">\n<h2 id=\"gallery-label\">Seize Today</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrapper\">\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"michigan-time\">\n<div class=\"pusedo-list-item images\">\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"Block C\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/block-m-maize.png\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border\">\n<img alt=\"24 Hours\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/includes/panels/gallery/images/24-hours.png\" style=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pusedo-list-item copy\">\n<h3>All Corravale, all the time</h3>\n<p>There's always something remarkable unfolding at Corravale. Whether it's here on campus or somewhere across the globe, our students, faculty, staff and alumni are out seizing the moment. A selection of images gathered over the years is featured in the gallery below.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"clear\">\n<li class=\"grid-4 unit8\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: right; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Rare books are researched and restored at the Aldwin Library.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/fce6e09caf7dc0ec.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:35 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A rare book collection at the Aldwin Library.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/45a75e75b4d19937.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:42 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"The Harlan T. Meade Reserve provides research and education opportunities in the natural sciences.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a94f8862f8518063.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:32 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A researcher working in the Rowe and Delia Marsh Cardiovascular Center.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/bbb53e02d581e77d.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:11 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A snowy view of the Law Quad framed by the stone archway.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/1fd9c15a12cd459f.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:49 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9 unit4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: right; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A graduate leans into a microphone during a student a cappella set on the lawn before the main stage at the 2024 Spring Commencement ceremony.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/c32660a5f9b9de25.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:57 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9 unit4\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: right; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A graduate in a cap decorated with a Block C made of sequins and gold and slate gemstones waves to someone across the crowd outside Corravale Stadium.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/32027c7f4e323658.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:02 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A long exposure shot of students strolling past the Homeward sculpture on an early Fall day with North Campus Hall, Alder Hall, and the Merrow Building rising in the background.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/07921e76b7569af8.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:44 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-9\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A group of four students wearing backpacks and each wearing matching tee shirts steps out of the tunnel running through West Hall toward the Green. The building’s tall red brick exterior and ornamental spires loom high above the students in the background. Small trees grow in planted beds on either side of the tunnel entrance.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/e6548a7da1e002fc.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:46 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A machinist at work in the College Scientific Instrument Shop.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/daba8bbd39dfbe1a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">8:31 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A student in a gray sweatshirt writes in a notebook with a yellow pencil at a long table in the Reference Room of the Ashwood Graduate Library.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/a76adadafe4a040e.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:10 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"ROTC cadets work together to hold and unfold a large American flag outside of the Chemistry building near the Green flag pole during an annual Veterans Day flag raising ceremony. In the background, cadets from the various ROTC programs stand at attention.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/044d154eb1914a4a.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">9:02 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Students put on face masks for a flu prevention study.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/6af4de40ef359f0b.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">10:15 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A local artist uses oil pastels to capture the peonies at peak bloom in the R.H. Calder Garden at Brightwood Arboretum.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/87615bec46077916.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">10:00 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A professor of applied optics, electrical engineering and computer science holds a chariot posture in his office on the North Ridge campus.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/51f64b7f00b7c5b0.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">10:10 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-16\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"A commuter shields herself from the light drizzle while waiting for her\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/983ddfed9ee4bdd4.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">10:12 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px;\">\n<img alt=\"Corravale scientists have earned a $2 million federal grant to discover and evaluate strains of green algae capable of powering a high-yield, environmentally responsible and affordable process for producing biofuels.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/8e50c95652e1b194.jpg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">11:48 am</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A student tests a prosthetic foot in the Applied Biomechanics and Control Lab.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:16 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A student tests a prosthetic foot in the Applied Biomechanics and Control Lab\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:34 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A small group of students sit in the grass on the Central Green as others walk along the pathway behind them. In the background, a gold “Welcome to Corravale” banner hangs on stone pillars above a flower garden.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:40 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Two students study on their laptops in the Hartwell Undergraduate Library.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">12:35 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Students on the sidewalk beneath the Central Campus Transit Center awning hurry to board a sleek electric blue bus bound for Hollisworth Commons. The arrival boards hanging above the crowd of students on the sidewalk display the route schedule.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:42 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A student reads a book while lying in the grass near the Cube sculpture in Founders Plaza on a warm summer afternoon.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:39 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A Campus Farm worker in a yellow shirt reading “Grow Together” leads a group of HarvestFest attendees on a tour of the Campus Farm. The group stands before a field filled with large leafy green vegetables. In the distance the Straw Bale House, white vendor tents, and the greenhouses dot the horizon.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:42 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"grid-25\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A staff member inspects the pneumatic tubes that carry patient-related messages in a mechanical room at the Corravale Health System.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:04 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A student walks along Meridian Street in front of the eight Doric columns that frame the entrance to Halloran Hall.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:18 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"A staff member hands a blue shirt reading “Corravale Pride” to a student in a brown tee shirt, tan hat, and black backpack at Pride Outside 2024.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:15 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"The Movement Science 210 class fits a student into a motion detection sensor suit for a study on how knee injuries restrict motion.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">1:47 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Students play a game of four square on the main lawn.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:08 pm</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"\" style=\"cursor: pointer; float: left; margin: 4px; display: none;\">\n<img alt=\"Members of the women's rowing team work out in the team room at the Campus Sports Building.\" data-credits=\"\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/_images/placeholder_152.svg\" style=\"\"/>\n<span class=\"time\">2:52 pm</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n<div class=\"wrapper clear\">\n<div class=\"column info\">\n<h1 class=\"logo\"><a href=\"/\">Corravale University</a></h1>\n<nav aria-label=\"Our Campuses\">\n<ul class=\"campuses\">\n<li><a href=\"/\"><span>Fairhaven</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Westgate</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>Alden</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<ul class=\"contact\">\n<li>© 2026 <a href=\"/_404.html\"><span>The Board of Regents of Corravale University</span></a> 1240 Larkspur Ave., Fairhaven, MI 48211-1044</li>\n<li><a href=\"/about/privacy/\"><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa fa-lock\"></i>Privacy Notice</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"phone\"><i class=\"fa fa-phone\"><span class=\"hidden\">Phone</span></i><a href=\"tel:+1-