{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_zdIB1we53lmrx1jSAsGx2054","type":"tool_result","content":"================================================================================\nabout.html contentlen 10327\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> About Welcome to Corravale University, a place shaped by enduring traditions and devoted to building brighter futures. We invite you to explore the spirited community that makes us the proud home of the Bold &amp; Boundless. Facts &amp; History Accreditation Annual Report F\n================================================================================\nabout__privacy-statement.html contentlen 13506\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Corravale Privacy Statement Last Revision Date — March 14, 2023 Corravale University (CU) recognizes and values the privacy of its community members and guests. This commitment is reflected in Trustees' Bylaw Sec. 14.07, Privacy and Access to Information, which states in pa\n================================================================================\nabout__privacy.html contentlen 9845\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Corravale Privacy Notice Last Revision Date — May 12, 2024 Corravale University recognizes and values the privacy of its community members and guests. We work to set the standard in the ways we handle your personal information. We are dedicated to transparency by helping yo\n================================================================================\nacademics.html contentlen 9076\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Academics Corravale's intellectual energy delivers distinction across every field and around the globe. We are counted among the leaders in higher education thanks to the outstanding strength of our 19 schools and colleges, globally respected faculty, and departments offeri\n================================================================================\nalumni.html contentlen 5009\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Alumni Corravale's graduates have gone on to reach the far edges of space, to spark movements that reshape culture and to guide nations. No matter how far they travel, they always seem to find their way home. We're proud to count one of the largest and most devoted communit\n================================================================================\nathletics.html contentlen 3362\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Athletics Rise Ravens! Corravale's proud athletics heritage began in 1889 and thrives to this day, with our teams earning more than 40 national championships across 15 varsity sports. Students, faculty and staff also take part in dozens of intramural, club sport and fitness\n================================================================================\ncontact.html contentlen 4317\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Contact Us Have a question but unsure where to start or whom to reach? To point you in the right direction, we've gathered some of the most frequently contacted Corravale departments in the table below. Should you not find the office tied to your particular need, please try\n================================================================================\ncurrent-students.html contentlen 17744\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Current Students With more than 1,100 student organizations and classmates from all fifty states and 108 countries, life at Corravale rarely stands still. Hundreds of campus tools, guides, events, and resources are here to help every student stay linked to the full campus e\n================================================================================\nfacts-figures.html contentlen 10266\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Facts &amp; Figures More than any institution before us, Corravale holds the potential to become far greater than the sum of its many remarkable parts. It is precisely this potential to shape the communities we serve that stands as our most enduring value as a university. B\n================================================================================\nfaculty-staff.html contentlen 7582\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Faculty and Staff Corravale is regarded as one of the best places to work in higher education, according to a national review of universities. We place a high priority on building an environment that helps faculty and staff do their finest work, and we value the contributio\n================================================================================\ngiving.html contentlen 4208\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Giving Corravale is dedicated to putting its academic strength and resources to work for the good of the wider world. A deeply rooted culture of philanthropy is what makes that ambition attainable. The generous commitment of our Corravale donors changes lives each day. Corr\n================================================================================\nhealth-medicine.html contentlen 3631\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Health &amp; Medicine Our award-winning Corravale Health System cares for millions of patients, leads hundreds of research studies and prepares thousands of tomorrow's medical professionals every year. For our students, faculty and staff, a broad range of health and wellnes\n================================================================================\nindex.html contentlen 23926\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Featured Stories Ancient desert reptiles were built to survive drought A Corravale study examining fossilized limb bones of ancient desert lizards has shown that these reptiles were evolving to endure extreme heat more than 5 million years before the region's modern arid cl\n================================================================================\ninitiatives.html contentlen 4674\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Initiatives Corravale leads a broad range of signature initiatives and outreach programs centered on priority areas that empower us to advance academic excellence, drive meaningful change, and confront the complex global challenges shaping our shared future. Sustainability \n================================================================================\nlife-at-michigan.html contentlen 7146\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Life at Corravale Drawing gifted faculty, staff and students from across the globe, the landmark Corravale campus overflows with fresh perspectives, opportunities and events. Everything unfolds within the lively setting of Fairhaven, a city celebrated for its thriving arts \n================================================================================\nparents.html contentlen 14901\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Parents Welcome to the Corravale family. Sending a student to college is a milestone for every household. Corravale is dedicated to helping parents and students make the most of this chapter by sharing up-to-date information about campus life, key dates, and upcoming events\n================================================================================\nprospective-students.html contentlen 9129\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Prospective Students Corravale's commitment to interdisciplinary study empowers students to shape their academic journey around their own career ambitions and personal goals. As one of the nation's largest public research universities, Corravale hosts thousands of active pr\n================================================================================\nresearch.html contentlen 25861\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Research With expenditures topping $1 billion, research sits at the core of Corravale's mission and extends across all 19 schools and colleges. Corravale is a strong champion of collaboration and interdisciplinary research initiatives that engage faculty and students from e\n================================================================================\nschools-colleges.html contentlen 3152\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Schools &amp; Colleges Students discover their passions and chart their futures across our 19 nationally recognized schools and colleges — the heart and soul of the Corravale experience at our flagship campus. Meanwhile, our Corravale Westgate and Corravale Alden campuses o\n================================================================================\nsearch.html contentlen 679\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Search Keywords Search <div class=\"clear\"\nShell cwd was reset to /workspace/recreation","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00ab4dff-b78b-4d55-b22f-84bc3198b5d8","uuid":"7ade016c-12fc-4f5e-9363-ae7d92dceb30","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:53:14.902Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"================================================================================\nabout.html contentlen 10327\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> About Welcome to Corravale University, a place shaped by enduring traditions and devoted to building brighter futures. We invite you to explore the spirited community that makes us the proud home of the Bold &amp; Boundless. Facts &amp; History Accreditation Annual Report F\n================================================================================\nabout__privacy-statement.html contentlen 13506\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Corravale Privacy Statement Last Revision Date — March 14, 2023 Corravale University (CU) recognizes and values the privacy of its community members and guests. This commitment is reflected in Trustees' Bylaw Sec. 14.07, Privacy and Access to Information, which states in pa\n================================================================================\nabout__privacy.html contentlen 9845\n  first text: id=\"content\" role=\"main\"> Corravale Privacy Notice Last Revision Date — May 12, 2024 Corra