{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_0","type":"tool_result","content":"████████ alumni ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Alumni\nP: Corravale's graduates have gone on to reach the far edges of space, to spark movements that reshape culture and to guide nations. No matter how far they travel, they always seem to find their way home. We're proud to count one of the largest and most devoted communities of living alumni anywhere. Go Vale!\n#### Stay in Touch\n- [L /_404.html] Alumni Association\n- [L /_404.html] Social Media Directory\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Make a Gift Online\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale AlumnusAlumni Magazine\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale TodayAlumni Magazine\n- [L /_404.html] Career Alumni Networking Association (CANA) \n- [L /_404.html] Update Your Graduate Profile\n#### Corravale Athletics\n- [L /_404.html] GoRavens.com\n- [L /_404.html] Tickets\n- [L /_404.html] Football Schedule\n#### Records & Transcripts\n- [L /_404.html] Request Transcript\n- [L /_404.html] Request Copy of Your Diploma\n- [L /_404.html] Update Your Graduate Profile\n#### Visiting\n- [L /_404.html] Art in Public Spaces\n- [L /_404.html] Maps, Directions & Transportation\n- [L /_404.html] New Weldon Convention & Visitors Bureau\n#### Career Services\n- [L /_404.html] Career Center\n- [L /_404.html] Career Development — Alumni Association\n- [L /_404.html] Jobs at CU\n#### Impact\n- [L /_404.html] CU + New Weldon\n- [L /_404.html] CU + Halbrook\n[IMG @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/alumni-fans.jpg]\nP: Fans pack the stands for a football game \"under the lights\" at Weldon Stadium\n[IMG The ensemble performs on stage during the Fall 2024 New Student Convocation. The student conductor turns toward the audience and raises a fist in triumph. Behind the players, the stage party and a large Welcome to Corravale banner fill the background. @@ /_images/9cc406322384fdf8.jpg]\nP: The ensemble performs on stage during the Fall 2024 New Student Convocation. The student conductor turns toward the audience and raises a fist in triumph. Behind the players, the stage party and a large Welcome to Corravale banner fill the background.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n████████ athletics ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Athletics\nP: Rise Ravens! Corravale's proud athletics heritage began in 1889 and thrives to this day, with our teams earning more than 40 national championships across 15 varsity sports. Students, faculty and staff also take part in dozens of intramural, club sport and fitness programs every year.\n#### Varsity Sports\n- [L /_404.html] GoRavens.com\n- [L /_404.html] Tickets\n- [L /_404.html] Competition Schedule\n#### Facilities\n- [L /_404.html] Athletics\n- [L /_404.html] Recreational Sports\n#### Club & Intramural Sports\n- [L /_404.html] Club Sports\n- [L /_404.html] Intramural Sports\n#### Seasonal Youth Athletics\n- [L /_404.html] Skills Clinics\n- [L /_404.html] PlayPals\n#### Campus Recreation & Wellness Offerings\n- [L /_404.html] Intramural Athletics\n- [L /_404.html] Wellness Classes\n[IMG Corravale Athletics is honored to deliver transformative experiences to over 900 student-athletes competing in 29 sports. @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/athletics-vollyball.jpg]\nP: Corravale Athletics is honored to deliver transformative experiences to over 900 student-athletes competing in 29 sports.\n[IMG Students enjoy an evening tennis match on the Rivergate courts just beyond the Halden-Brooks Residence Hall. @@ /_images/c70ba4e7acc71795.jpg]\nP: Students enjoy an evening tennis match on the Rivergate courts just beyond the Halden-Brooks Residence Hall.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n████████ contact ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Contact Us\nP: Have a question but unsure where to start or whom to reach? To point you in the right direction, we've gathered some of the most frequently contacted Corravale departments in the table below. Should you not find the office tied to your particular need, please try our site search to locate the right resource.\n#### Most Frequently Reached Campus\n- \nDepartment\nOperators\nPhone\n734-764-1817\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Undergraduate Admissions\nPhone\n734-764-7433\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Graduate Admissions\nPhone\n734-764-8129\nEmail\nadmissions@corravale.edu\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Central Information Desk\nPhone\n734-764-INFO (4636)\nEmail\ninfo@corravale.edu\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Aid & Funding\nPhone\n734-763-6600\nEmail\nfinancial.aid@corravale.edu\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Housing & Residence\nPhone\n734-763-3164\nEmail\nhousing@corravale.edu\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Technology Support Desk\nPhone\n734-764-HELP (4357)\nEmail\nithelp@corravale.edu\nChat\n[L /_404.html] Chat with a support agent\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Web Accessibility\nWebsite\n[L /_404.html] Report a Web Accessibility Issue\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Corravale News\nPhone\n734-764-7260\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Social Media Listings\n- \nDepartment\n[L /_404.html] Corravale Health\nPhone\n734-936-6641\n#### More Contact Options and Links\n- [L /schools-colleges/] Find a Department or Unit\n- [L /_404.html] Find People on Campus\n- [L /_404.html] Request Transcripts\n- [L /_404.html] Public Records Requests\n#### Mailing Addresses\nP: Every campus office at Corravale maintains a unique mailing address. Please [L /search/] browse our website for a college or unit page to locate the mailing addresses for specific offices.\n#### [L /_404.html] Getting Here/Maps/Directions\n<div class=\"clear\" \n████████ faculty-staff ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Faculty and Staff\nP: Corravale is regarded as one of the best places to work in higher education, according to a national review of universities. We place a high priority on building an environment that helps faculty and staff do their finest work, and we value the contributions of every employee in keeping Corravale a leading public institution.\n#### Tools\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale Access\n- [L /_404.html] Email\n- [L /_404.html] Email — CHS\n- [L /_404.html] Portal\n- [L /_404.html] Community Directory\n- [L /_404.html] Campus AI Tools\n- [L /_404.html] Library Catalog\n- [L /_404.html] Compliance Hotline\n- [L /_404.html] Children on Campus Registration\n#### Jobs & Career Paths\n- [L /_404.html] Job Openings\n- [L /_404.html] Career Explorer\n#### Faculty & Staff Support\n- [L /_404.html] Coverage\n- [L /_404.html] Campus Alert Enrollment\n- [L /_404.html] People & Culture\n- [L /_404.html] Tech Accessibility\n- [L /_404.html] Delivery, Transportation & Parking\n- [L /_404.html] Occupational Wellness Center\n- [L /_404.html] Office of the Faculty Liaison\n- [L /_404.html] Office of the Staff Advocate\n- [L /_404.html] Pay Hub\n- [L /_404.html] Purchasing Services\n- [L /_404.html] Social Media Toolkit\n- [L /_404.html] Campus Health Brief\n- [L /_404.html] University LedgerFaculty & Staff Notes\n- [L /_404.html] Vax Status\n- [L /_404.html] Well-Being Coalition\n#### Teaching & Scholarship Resources\n- [L /_404.html] Center for Learning Innovation\n- [L /_404.html] Center for the Study of Learning & Teaching\n- [L /_404.html] Learning with Technology Collaborative\n- [L /_404.html] Educator Handbook\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale Publishing\n#### Schedules\n- [L /_404.html] Academic Schedule\n- [L /_404.html] Events Schedule\n- [L /_404.html] Holiday Calendar\n#### Central Offices\n- [L /_404.html] Board of Trustees\n- [L /_404.html] Office of the Chancellor\n- [L /_404.html] Academic Affairs Office\n- \nLeadership Offices\n- [L /_404.html] Business and Budget\n- [L /_404.html] Public Affairs\n- [L /_404.html] Advancement\n- [L /_404.html] Legal Affairs\n- [L /_404.html] Government Affairs\n- [L /_404.html] Technology & Systems\n- [L /_404.html] Clinical Affairs\n- [L /_404.html] Discovery\n- [L /_404.html] Secretary of the Institution\n- [L /_404.html] Campus Life\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale University-Rothwell\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale University-Alden\n- [L /_404.html] Key Topics\n[IMG Bring your best self to work. Learn how ThriveWell's health and wellness programs boost everyday well-being. @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/facstaff-mhealthy-2016.jpg]\nP: \n Bring your best self to work. Learn how ThriveWell's health and wellness programs boost everyday well-being.\n [L /_404.html] Explore ThriveWell's programs and services in depth.\n[IMG A pharmacist fills a prescription at the Corravale Health System pharmacy. @@ /_images/20dbb0ba571c46f6.jpg]\nP: A pharmacist fills a prescription at the Corravale Health System pharmacy.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n████████ giving ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Giving\nP: Corravale is dedicated to putting its academic strength and resources to work for the good of the wider world. A deeply rooted culture of philanthropy is what makes that ambition attainable. The generous commitment of our Corravale donors changes lives each day.\n#### Corravale Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Make a Gift to CU\n- [L /_404.html] Stories and News\n#### Ways to Give\n- [L /_404.html] Give Today\n- [L /_404.html] Crowdfunding at CU\nShell cwd was reset to /workspace/recreation","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00ab4dff-b78b-4d55-b22f-84bc3198b5d8","uuid":"47ca7f48-d39f-4d5c-a0ee-34da2bc15fd6","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:56:26.297Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"████████ alumni ████████████\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Alumni\nP: Corravale's graduates have gone on to reach the far edges of space, to spark movements that reshape culture and to guide nations. No matter how far they travel, they always seem to find their way home. We're proud to count one of the largest and most devoted communities of living alumni anywhere. Go Vale!\n#### Stay in Touch\n- [L /_404.html] Alumni Association\n- [L /_404.html] Social Media Directory\n- [L /_40