an evening tennis match on the Rivergate courts just beyond the Halden-Brooks Residence Hall.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n########## giving ##########\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Giving\nP: Corravale is dedicated to putting its academic strength and resources to work for the good of the wider world. A deeply rooted culture of philanthropy is what makes that ambition attainable. The generous commitment of our Corravale donors changes lives each day.\n#### Corravale Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Make a Gift to CU\n- [L /_404.html] Stories and News\n#### Ways to Give\n- [L /_404.html] Give Today\n- [L /_404.html] Crowdfunding at CU\n- [L /_404.html] Cryptocurrency\n- [L /_404.html] Donor Advised Funds\n- [L /_404.html] Employer Matching\n- [L /_404.html] Giving from Abroad\n- [L /_404.html] Gifts-in-Kind\n- [L /_404.html] Estate and Legacy Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Multiyear Pledges\n- [L /_404.html] Securities and Bonds\n- [L /_404.html] Memorial and Honor Gifts\n- [L /_404.html] Wire and ACH Bank Transfers\n#### Talk with Our Teams\n- [L /_404.html] Message Us\n- [L /_404.html] Corporate Partners\n- [L /_404.html] Foundation Partners\n- [L /_404.html] Global Engagement Center\n- [L /_404.html] Regional Major Gifts\n- [L /_404.html] Family & Parent Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Legacy Giving\n- [L /_404.html] Campus Life\n[IMG Corravale students write thank-you notes expressing their gratitude to alumni and donors @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/giving-thanks.jpg]\nP: Corravale students write thank-you notes expressing their gratitude to alumni and donors\n[IMG An ecology and evolutionary biology student catalogs a collection of aquatic life at the Halvorsen Building. @@ /_images/ebd84c897f4b6e90.jpg]\nP: An ecology and evolutionary biology student catalogs a collection of aquatic life at the Halvorsen Building.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n########## health-medicine ##########\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Health & Medicine\nP: Our award-winning Corravale Health System cares for millions of patients, leads hundreds of research studies and prepares thousands of tomorrow's medical professionals every year. For our students, faculty and staff, a broad range of health and wellness services and programs are offered across campus.\n#### Health System\n- [L /_404.html] MyCorraHealth.org Patient Portal\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale Health\n#### Health Services for Students, Faculty & Staff\n- [L /_404.html] University Health & Counseling\n- [L /_404.html] Mental Health Resources\n- [L /_404.html] Employee Benefits\n- [L /_404.html] CorraWell Health and Well-being Programs\n- [L /_404.html] Corravale Health Line\n- [L /_404.html] Well-Being Collective\n#### Health & Medicine Programs\n- [L /_404.html] College of Optometry\n- [L /_404.html] Medical College\n- [L /_404.html] College of Dentistry\n- [L /_404.html] School of Physiology\n- [L /_404.html] College of Nursing\n- [L /_404.html] School of Global Health\n[IMG The Advanced Simulation Lab lets aspiring physicians practice on lifelike patient models at the Corravale Medical College @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/healthmed-surgery.jpg]\nP: The Advanced Simulation Lab lets aspiring physicians practice on lifelike patient models at the Corravale Medical College\n[IMG Dana Okafor, pharmacist at Fairmont Grocers, gives a vaccine. Elias Warren, junior at Corravale, receives his shot. @@ /_images/79752bbcb0d3026e.jpg]\nP: Dana Okafor, pharmacist at Fairmont Grocers, gives a vaccine. Elias Warren, junior at Corravale, receives his shot.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n########## initiatives ##########\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Initiatives\nP: Corravale leads a broad range of signature initiatives and outreach programs centered on priority areas that empower us to advance academic excellence, drive meaningful change, and confront the complex global challenges shaping our shared future.\n#### Sustainability\n- [L /_404.html] Corra Green\n- [L /_404.html] Follow our journey toward full carbon neutrality\n- [L /_404.html] 100+ green organizations across campus\n- [L /_404.html] 800+ green-focused courses\n- [L /_404.html] Learn “where it goes”\n- [L /_404.html] School of Environmental and Earth Studies\n#### Leadership Initiatives & Focus Areas\n- [L /_404.html] Arts Initiative\n- [L /_404.html] Campus Climate: Sexual Misconduct\n- [L /_404.html] Master Plan 2050\n- [L /_404.html] Climate, Sustainability, and a Carbon-Free Future\n- [L /_404.html] Health and Wellness\n- [L /_404.html] Shared Heritage Project\n- [L /_404.html] Look to Corravale\n- [L /_404.html] Bold Ideas in Teaching and Research\n#### Outreach & Partnership\n- [L /_404.html] Government Affairs\n- [L /_404.html] Industry Engagement Center\n- [L /_404.html] Technology Partnerships \n- [L /_404.html] CV + Rivbend\n- [L /_404.html] Statewide Research Corridor\n#### Impact\n- [L /_404.html] CV + Fairhaven\n- [L /_404.html] CV + Rivbend\n- [L /_404.html] Cost Savings & Budget\n[IMG Student volunteers help tend the Campus Farm at the Corravale Botanical Gardens @@ /media/images/sidebar-images/initiatives-garden.jpg]\nP: Student volunteers help tend the Campus Farm at the Corravale Botanical Gardens\n[IMG CV researchers have received a $2 million federal grant to identify and cultivate green algae that can power a high-yield, environmentally sustainable and cost-effective system for producing clean biofuels. @@ /_images/82b8d85bd2ab2b86.jpg]\nP: CV researchers have received a $2 million federal grant to identify and cultivate green algae that can power a high-yield, environmentally sustainable and cost-effective system for producing clean biofuels.\n<div class=\"clear\" \n########## schools-colleges ##########\nid=\"content\" role=\"main\">\n## Schools & Colleges\nP: Students discover their passions and chart their futures across our 19 nationally recognized schools and colleges — the heart and soul of the Corravale experience at our flagship campus. Meanwhile, our Corravale Westgate and Corravale Alden 